(text "RILIM 3.3k: nominal 5.45 A (5.02..5.90 A including +/-7% IC and 1% resistor).\nTPS26631 permits a 2x overload pulse before limiting/latching: this is not an instantaneous 5 A clamp.\nIMON: 27.9 uA/A x 8.2k = 0.22878 V/A; +/-6% above 2 A, +/-8% at 0.6..2 A; calibrate each outlet.\nUVLO ~9.38 V rising / OVP ~21.1 V. MODE open: latch off, reset with ENABLE low then high.\nNo external blocking FET: do not backfeed power into OUT. Allocate heat-spreading copper and thermal vias.\nENABLE pulldown is 10k: the SHDN internal source can be 10 uA. Plain GPIO switching only; never PWM." (at 25.4000 223.5200 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "05ccdf6a-af49-5e99-8dc5-f8d1bff70df2"))
